{"seq":2,"slug":"infrared-raman","title":"红外与拉曼光谱（Infrared and Raman Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/infrared-raman","wordCount":1971,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"红外与拉曼光谱-infrared-and-raman-spectroscopy\">红外与拉曼光谱（Infrared and Raman Spectroscopy）</h1><p>1928 年 2 月 28 日，C. V. Raman 在加尔各答大学观察到一个当时令人费解的现象：单色光穿过液体后，散射光里出现了与入射频率不同的成分——分子把光子的一部分能量&quot;截留&quot;给了自身的振动。几个月内论文发表于《Indian Journal of Physics》（同年 Nature 也刊出快报），两年后他站上诺贝尔物理学奖领奖台。红外吸收的历史则更早：Coblentz 从 1905 年起系统测绘数百种化合物的红外谱图，奠定了&quot;官能团指纹&quot;这门手艺。两种技术看的是同一批振动能级、却用两套完全不同的物理机制——理解它们的互补性是本篇的主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-振动模式数与双选择定则\">核心概念：振动模式数与双选择定则</h2><p>非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 原子分子的振动自由度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3N-6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>（线性为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3N-5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>），水 3 个、苯 30 个。但<strong>不是每个模式都能被红外看到</strong>——红外活性要求振动过程中偶极矩变化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial\\mu/\\partial q \\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），拉曼活性则要求极化率变化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial\\alpha/\\partial q \\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）。两条定则的互补性在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上展示得最干净：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>波数/cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>红外</th>\n<th>拉曼</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对称伸缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>约 1333</td>\n<td>无活性</td>\n<td>有活性</td>\n<td>偶极矩不变，极化率周期变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弯曲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（二重简并）</td>\n<td>约 667</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>偶极矩随弯曲振荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反对称伸缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>约 2349</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>偶极矩剧烈变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有对称中心的分子里两条定则互斥（互斥规则）：红外看见的拉曼看不见，反之亦然。这就是同核双原子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>N</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{N}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）只出现在拉曼谱的原因——它们伸缩时偶极矩恒为零。实战推论：水在红外有强且宽的 OH 吸收（约 3400 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），而水的拉曼谱相对安静，含水体系（生物样品、电化学界面）优先选拉曼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"官能团指纹-特征频率表\">官能团指纹：特征频率表</h2><p>力常数与折合质量决定频率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ν</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∝</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\nu} \\propto \\sqrt{k/\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），化学键类型因此直接映射到波数区间——单键约 500 N/m、双键约 1000、三键约 1500 N/m 的力常数阶梯给出清晰的频带分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域/cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>典型值与备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3700–3200</td>\n<td>O–H / N–H 伸缩</td>\n<td>醇宽约 3300（氢键致宽）；胺双峰约 3400/3300</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3300–3000</td>\n<td>炔氢、烯氢、芳氢</td>\n<td>炔氢尖锐约 3300；芳环约 3030</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2850–2960</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>sp</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sp}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> C–H</td>\n<td>烷烃密集多峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2720 与 2820</td>\n<td>醛基 C–H</td>\n<td>Fermi 双峰，醛的专属签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2500–2000</td>\n<td>C≡C、C≡N</td>\n<td>腈尖峰约 2250；炔约 2100–2260</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1870–1540</td>\n<td>C=O</td>\n<td>酮约 1715、酯约 1735、酰胺 I 带约 1650</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1650–1430</td>\n<td>C=C 与芳环骨架</td>\n<td>苯环邻/间/对取代由指纹区区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1500–500</td>\n<td>指纹区</td>\n<td>弯曲振动与骨架耦合，逐峰比对标准谱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>指认纪律：高频官能团区做&quot;有没有&quot;，低频指纹区做&quot;是谁&quot;。羰基区的细分逻辑值得背下来——诱导效应升频（酰氯约 1800）、共轭降频（烯酮约 1685）、环张力升频（环丁酮约 1780）：1700 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近的一张小表读出的是电子效应与构象约束的总和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拉曼的独特武器库\">拉曼的独特武器库</h2><p>拉曼散射截面极小（比红外吸收弱若干个数量级），经典色散时代这是致命弱点；激光改变了游戏规则。三项增强技术各有物理根源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>共振拉曼</strong>：把激发波长对准生色团的电子吸收带（呼应<a href=\"uv-vis-fluorescence\">紫外-可见一篇</a>的跃迁语言），该生色团的振动模式信号可放大两到六个数量级——等于给目标片段上了聚光灯，血红蛋白的铁卟啉振动因此能从整蛋白背景中单独读出。</li>\n<li><strong>表面增强拉曼（SERS）</strong>：1974 年 Fleischmann 在粗糙银电极上意外观察到超强信号，Jeanmaire 与 Van Duyne 于 1977 年在《Journal of Electroanalytical Chemistry》给出电磁增强解释——纳米金属表面的局域等离激元放大局域场，增强因子可达百万倍以上，单分子检测由此成为可能。</li>\n<li><strong>偏振拉曼</strong>：退偏比区分振动对称性，为群论归属提供实验输入。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;要鉴定什么振动信息?&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;样品含水?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;优先拉曼&lt;br&gt;避开水的强红外吸收&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D[&quot;FTIR 快速扫描&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E{&quot;需要极高灵敏度?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;痕量或表面物种&quot;| F[&quot;SERS 或共振拉曼&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;常规官能团确认&quot;| G[&quot;特征频率表比对&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;交叉验证: IR 与拉曼&lt;br&gt;互补不重复&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"要鉴定什么振动信息?\"] --&gt; B{\"样品含水?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"优先拉曼&lt;br&gt;避开水的强红外吸收\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| D[\"FTIR 快速扫描\"]\n    C --&gt; E{\"需要极高灵敏度?\"}\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|\"痕量或表面物种\"| F[\"SERS 或共振拉曼\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"常规官能团确认\"| G[\"特征频率表比对\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"交叉验证: IR 与拉曼&lt;br&gt;互补不重复\"]</pre><h2 id=\"ftir-为什么统治了实验室\">FTIR 为什么统治了实验室</h2><p>现代红外几乎全是傅里叶变换型：Michelson 干涉仪让所有波长同时测量，一次采集即得干涉图，经傅里叶变换还原为光谱。相比逐波长扫描的色散型，FTIR 赢在三处：多通道优势（信噪比随扫描次数的平方根改善）、通量优势（无狭缝损耗）、波长精度由氦氖激光校准带来的重现性。快速扫描还催生了红外显微成像与原位反应跟踪——催化剂表面中间体的秒级观测，正对接<a href=\"../chemical-kinetics/catalysis-surface\">催化与表面化学</a>的原位表征需求。计算化学同样深度介入：DFT 计算的谐振频率乘以约 0.96 的校正因子后可直接辅助指认（见<a href=\"../quantum-chemistry/computational-chemistry\">计算化学</a>），复杂分子的疑难峰先算再测已是常规流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一张谱图的完整解读-乙酸乙酯示范\">一张谱图的完整解读：乙酸乙酯示范</h2><p>把纪律落到实例上。乙酸乙酯的红外谱从高频往低读：2980 与 2900 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近的密集峰是乙基的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>sp</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sp}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> C–H；无 3300 以上宽峰，排除羟基与胺；1735 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的强峰锁定酯羰基（比酮的 1715 高，因为相邻氧的诱导效应）；1250 与 1050 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的强吸收对是 C–O–C 不对称/对称伸缩，酯的第二签名；1360 与 1460 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的弯曲带属于甲基。到此可以自信指认：脂肪族酯。若 2720 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出现双峰则要回头怀疑甲酸酯（醛氢签名）；若羰基降到 1715 附近且出现烯氢，则是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-不饱和酯。拉曼侧的分工也清晰：C=O 在拉曼中较弱，而 C=C 与芳环骨架模式突出——同一瓶样品两种谱互补，误判率显著下降。这个流程的价值在于它是<strong>可复制的</strong>：先排他（有没有宽 OH？）、再定位（最强峰在哪一类？）、最后核对（指纹区是否吻合标准谱），顺序错了就会被某个巧合峰带走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与常见误判\">反模式与常见误判</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>只看一个峰下结论</strong>。1715 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能是酮也可能是共轭酯；确认官能团需要&quot;一组峰&quot;（如醛的 C=O 加 Fermi 双峰）加指纹区核对。</li>\n<li><strong>忽略样品状态对频率的影响</strong>。氢键能把醇 OH 从气相的约 3620 拉到液态的约 3300 cm<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且致宽；固态谱与溶液谱的差异足以误判取代模式。</li>\n<li><strong>以为拉曼弱就是含量低</strong>。拉曼强度受共振增强、聚焦与基底影响极大；定量拉曼必须用内标，不能拿绝对强度比浓度。</li>\n<li><strong>荧光淹没信号时硬扫到底</strong>。生物样品常被自发荧光盖过拉曼；换长波激发（785/1064 nm）、改 SERS 基底或改测红外才是出路。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>红外与拉曼探测同一组振动能级而机制分立（偶极矩 vs 极化率）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 三模式与同核双原子是互补性的标准教案。</li>\n<li>特征频率表把键类型翻译成波数区间：官能团区定性、指纹区验明正身，羰基区位移浓缩了电子效应与环张力。</li>\n<li>共振拉曼、SERS 与 FTIR 多通道优势分别解决灵敏度、表面选择性与速度问题，让振动光谱从离线表征走进原位监测。</li>\n<li>水的干扰方向相反（红外怕水、拉曼不怕），这一条几乎决定了含水样品的技术路线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"红外与拉曼光谱（Infrared and Raman Spectroscopy）","id":"红外与拉曼光谱-infrared-and-raman-spectroscopy"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：振动模式数与双选择定则","id":"核心概念-振动模式数与双选择定则"},{"level":2,"text":"官能团指纹：特征频率表","id":"官能团指纹-特征频率表"},{"level":2,"text":"拉曼的独特武器库","id":"拉曼的独特武器库"},{"level":2,"text":"FTIR 为什么统治了实验室","id":"ftir-为什么统治了实验室"},{"level":2,"text":"一张谱图的完整解读：乙酸乙酯示范","id":"一张谱图的完整解读-乙酸乙酯示范"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与常见误判","id":"反模式与常见误判"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"紫外-可见吸收与荧光光谱（UV-Vis and Fluorescence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/uv-vis-fluorescence"},"next":{"title":"核磁共振波谱（NMR Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/nmr-spectroscopy"}}